\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\fs20 Gradius (NES) - GameMaker Studio 1.4.1760 Skeleton\par
\par
Controls:\par
  Arrows / WASD : D-Pad\par
  Z / Space     : A Button (Fire)\par
  X / Shift     : B Button (Activate Power-Up)\par
  C / Backspace : Select (1P / 2P on Title)\par
  Enter         : Start / Pause\par
  F1            : Toggle NES timing / RAM debug overlay\par
  F2            : Dev helper - advance power-up gauge\par
